# 📚 Today's Topic

## 📖 Reading & Writing CSV Files as Dictionaries

### 🌟 Why are we learning this?

Using dictionaries makes your code easier to read and maintain. Instead of remembering that `row[2]` is the age, you can simply write `row["Age"]`.

